Package: dnsmasq-webmin
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= @PY@), python3 (<< @PY_NEXT@)
Recommends: dnsmasq
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/alirionx/dnsmasq-webmin
Description: web UI and REST API for dnsmasq DNS entries and DHCP ranges
 Manages dnsmasq sub config files in /etc/dnsmasq.d (host-record, address,
 cname, dhcp-range) through a FastAPI REST API and a Vue/Vuetify web UI.
 The main dnsmasq configuration is never touched. Optionally restarts
 dnsmasq via systemd after validating the config with 'dnsmasq --test'.
 .
 Python dependencies are bundled in /opt/dnsmasq-webmin/lib.
